1. STS2 LAN Connect (the mod this patch repairs)
-----------------------------------------------
Project : STS2 LAN Connect / 游戏大厅, mod id `sts2_lan_connect`, version 0.6.4
Author  : "mac"
Licence : GNU General Public License v3.0
Source  : https://github.com/emptylower/STS2-Game-Lobby
Workshop: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3749766330

No file, binary or archive from that project is redistributed here. This mod is published as a
separate Workshop item that *declares* the item above as a required dependency, and it locates the
