.NET SDK and runtime (MIT), xUnit.net (Apache-2.0), Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk (MIT) and Pillow
(MIT-CMU licence, used once to generate `image.png`). None of these are redistributed in the Workshop
upload; they are development-time dependencies only.


